WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
With the emulator booted and the app installed,

2
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:08.798
run the capture rn command with the platform and device.

3
00:00:08.848 --> 00:00:14.449
It starts Metro in Storybook mode, opens each story, screenshots it,

4
00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:17.795
and writes a bundle to .scry/capture.

5
00:00:17.845 --> 00:00:24.240
It ends by reporting how many stories were captured and how many were skipped.

